<title>USA: TABLE-Executone Q2 shr loss $0.05.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Executone Q2 shr loss $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>MILFORD, Conn 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Executone Information Systems Inc</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>(In Thousands,</p>
<p> Except Per Share Amounts)     June 30,		  June 30,</p>
<p>				    1997     1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		    $34,777    51,982  73,796   $118,948</p>
